wildos-system-dialogs (0.1.3) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Board 9.9 also asks before Windows alone restarts or shuts down from
    the taskbar panel (windows-restart, windows-shutdown): no countdown,
    Go back as the safe answer, and for Shut down, Save to disk instead.
  * The minute before Windows apps' work is kept now counts down and ends:
    Qt 6 refused the timer's connection, so it stayed at 60 seconds.
  * Enter presses the button that has focus.

 -- Wild OS Developers <dev@wildos.io>  Tue, 10 Nov 2026 14:50:00 +0000

